\**{c=red:Note:}** This mission is skippable and not required to progress.
=2 Walkthrough
* Accept the mission from the {n:Gate Guard}.
** **(Optional)**: As usual, you can speak to the gate guards for additional dialogue.
* Head to (L-6) in {z:Windurst Waters} and speak to {n:Moreno-Toeno} (inside the {p:Aurastery}), who gives you the {@k} {k:"Creature Counter" magic doll} to keep track of your objective.
** **(Optional)**: You can talk to the students on the roof and the other NPCs in the same room as {n:Moreno-Toeno} for additional dialogue.
** You can save some time by setting your {p:Home Point} in {z:Windurst Waters} and bringing a Warp item.

=3 First-Time
* Head to {z:Tahrongi Canyon} and start killing monsters.
** You have exactly 24 **game** hours (1 Earth time hour) to kill at least 30 monsters in the Canyon and return to {n:Moreno-Toeno}.
* Upon defeating 30 monsters, return to {n:Moreno-Toeno}.

=3 Repeating
* Head to {z:Buburimu Peninsula} and start killing monsters.
** You have exactly 48 **game** hours (2 Earth time hours) to kill at least 30 monsters in the Peninsula and return to {n:Moreno-Toeno}.
* Upon defeating 30 monsters, return to {n:Moreno-Toeno}.

=3 Getting Assessed
* Return to {n:Moreno-Toeno} in {z:Windurst Waters} and speak to him in the **final** game hour of the time limit. Speaking to him any sooner will tell you how long you have left. Speaking to him later will fail the Mission.
** This has lead to a lot of confusion over the years. If you are doing the Mission for the first time and accepted it at 06:00 **game** hour, he will only complete the Mission if the current time is between 05:00 and 06:00 on the next **game** day.
*** Despite the in-game text, it's not the whole-hour time, so if you accept at 11:30 then you can turn in at 11:30 the next gameday and do not have to wait for 12:00 (and likely will time-out if you go past 12:30).
** Example time remaining report at 16:00 when the hour you need to report is 12:00~13:00 (20 game hours later):

__Wow...I avow it's now 16!__
__So, lo, 20 hours to go.__
__Sublime! You have plenty of time till the chime.__
* You will fail this Mission if you do not return on time or defeat enough monsters. You will, however, be allowed to progress to the next Mission if you fill your Rank bar via other means.

